  "description": "Hello fellow Sharks,",
  "body_html": "<p>Hello fellow Sharks,</p><p>I am closing three positions in Portfolio USA. I am building a cash position in preparation for a couple of new positions, and the risk-reward of these three positions is no longer attractive.</p><p>Close: <strong>RCL, QUBT, BLBD</strong></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!INis!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F670744b3-ef6a-4138-802d-031bc20d6eca_1732x220.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!INis!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F670744b3-ef6a-4138-802d-031bc20d6eca_1732x220.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!INis!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F670744b3-ef6a-4138-802d-031bc20d6eca_1732x220.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!INis!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F670744b3-ef6a-4138-802d-031bc20d6eca_1732x220.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!INis!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F670744b3-ef6a-4138-802d-031bc20d6eca_1732x220.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"185\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/670744b3-ef6a-4138-802d-031bc20d6eca_1732x220.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:185,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&q